}, "body": "はじめまして！今回初めてリクエストさせていただきます\n戦姫絶唱シンフォギアのキャロルちゃんでお願いします！できましたらGXの大人バージョンでお願いします\n資料のように腰に手を当ててカッコいい表情でお願いします！\nその他の構成はお任せします！\nもし可能ならパチンコで使いたいのでセリフとかで右打ちだ！！と感じで入れてもらえたら嬉しいでさ！\nぜひお願いします！！キャロルちゃんみたい！！\n\nhttps://x.com/i/status/2054141352326418806", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Goounagi/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2919411, "client_id": 1519978, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fc52cdf0/uploads/origins/93a345b9-69a4-476c-82bc-b7438942fe20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c86ccfc67151f05c1d4df1c2c7116d44", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fc52cdf0/uploads/origins/93a345b9-69a4-476c-82bc-b7438942fe20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c86ccfc67151f05c1d4df1c2c7116d44, https://si.imgix.net/fc52cdf0/uploads/origins/93a345b9-69a4-476c-82bc-b7438942fe20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc241553a8d20db872b4b7180350f20a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fc52cdf0/uploads/origins/93a345b9-69a4-476c-82bc-b7438942fe20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee1e6dc41434ff634197df258a41ea03 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": true, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fc52cdf0/uploads/origins/93a345b9-69a4-476c-82bc-b7438942fe20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5f613aceac588c5b7b28d63cc5856171", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fc52cdf0/uploads/origins/93a345b9-69a4-476c-82bc-b7438942fe20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5f613aceac588c5b7b28d63cc5856171, https://si.imgix.net/fc52cdf0/uploads/origins/93a345b9-69a4-476c-82bc-b7438942fe20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&cro